        <details>Particle image stack "ribosomeSelB_particles.mrcs":
CTF corrected particles images (not normalized; total 969.526 particles)

Star-files for particles corresponding to distinct states in "ribosomeSelB_particles.mrcs":
1. "particles_IC_state.star": particles of initial complex, E. coli ribosome 70S-fMet-  tRNAfmet-SECIS mRNA complex (IC)
2. "particles_IB_state.star": particles of initial binding state of E. coli ribosome 70S-SelB-GDPNP-Phe-tRNAPhe-fMet-tRNAfmet-SECIS mRNA complex (IB)
3. "particles_CR_state.star": particles of codon reading state of E. coli ribosome 70S-SelB-GDPNP-Phe-tRNAPhe-fMet-tRNAfmet-SECIS mRNA complex (CR)
4. "particles_GA_state.star": particles of GTPase activated state of E. coli ribosome 70S-SelB-GDPNP-Phe-tRNAPhe-fMet-tRNAfmet-SECIS mRNA complex (GA)
5. "particles_C_state.star": particles of classical pre-translocation state of E. coli ribosome 70S-Phe-tRNAPhe-fMet-tRNAfmet-SECIS mRNA complex (C)
6. "particles_H_state.star": particles of hybrid pre-translocation state of E. coli ribosome 70S-Phe-tRNAPhe-fMet-tRNAfmet-SECIS mRNA complex (H)</details>
